  "description": "The 'Crayon' series, beloved by children and creative adults worldwide, now dives into a mysterious underwater world! 'Crayon Sea Friends' is a creativity game where you fill adorable whales, playful turtles, sparkling fish, and other diverse marine creatures with your own colors.\n\nIt offers an intuitive interface that anyone can easily enjoy without complicated controls, and it recreates the texture of coloring with real crayons through precise touch controls. Watch your completed sea friends come to life with vivid animation. It will be the most perfect digital sketchbook, offering both educational fun and emotional stability.",
